# Stack

- Next.js 16, Postgres via Supabase, Drizzle ORM, Vercel hosting.
- Search: `pg_trgm` only. Do not add Typesense/Meilisearch/Elastic
  without explicit sign-off.
- Graph UI: react-flow for the cognate view.
- Fonts via `next/font/google`: Inter primary; load Noto Sans Hebrew /
  Arabic / Devanagari only for scripts Inter doesn't cover, via CSS
  font-family fallback. Never bulk-load all Noto script families.
- Testing: Playwright for E2E. Unit-test the ETL transform step — it's
  the most likely place to silently produce wrong data.
- All DB access through Drizzle. No raw SQL in app code outside
  migrations/seeds.
- Every enriched field traces to a `source` (and ideally `source_url`) —
  never write enrichment content without attribution.
